        "richtext_aCRd9T": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>An emerald cut promise ring offer a refined and understated way to symbolise love and commitment. Defined by their clean lines and elongated rectangular shape, the emerald cut is known for its quiet elegance, favouring clarity and symmetry over sparkle.<br/><br/>Rather than relying on brilliance alone, emerald cut stones create a distinctive “hall of mirrors” effect, reflecting light in smooth, structured flashes that feel calm and sophisticated.<br/><br/>At The Promise Co, emerald cut promise rings are designed for those who appreciate subtle confidence. The shape feels intentional and considered, making it a natural choice for a promise that is built on clarity, trust and depth.</p>"
          }
        }
