        "richtext_HCa4xK": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<ul><li>The emerald cut stands apart from other stone shapes through its structure. Its step-cut facets and open surface place emphasis on the natural beauty of the stone, creating a look that feels clean, modern and architectural.<br/></li><li>A rectangular shape with soft, cut corners</li><li>Step-cut facets that create a smooth, reflective finish</li><li>A refined alternative to more sparkly, traditional cuts</li><li>Style associated with understated luxury and confidence</li></ul><p>Because of its simplicity, the emerald cut is often chosen by those who want a ring that feels elegant without being overstated.</p>"
          }
        }
