        "richtext_QwDigH": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Emerald cut promise rings are often chosen by those who prefer a more understated style. While other cuts focus on sparkle, the emerald cut focuses on presence, shape and proportion.<br/><br/>This gives it a unique appeal. It feels less about drawing attention, and more about expressing confidence through simplicity. The elongated shape also creates a flattering look on the hand, adding to its timeless appeal.<br/><br/>For those who want a promise ring that feels modern, elegant and quietly distinctive, the emerald cut offers something truly different.</p>"
